  = note: the Rust signature is `fn name<T: varyk_std::serde::Serialize + ? Sized>(&self, value: &T) -> &str`
  = note: Varyk does not import a generic Rust function that returns a reference, even a `&self` method; return an owned value, such as `String` instead of `&str`
